---
// English translation of /privacidad.
import LegalPage from '../components/ds/LegalPage.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'October 26, 2026';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Privacy policy — RateHub"
  description="How RateHub handles personal data received through this website."
  lang="en"
>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: {lastUpdated} · <a href="/privacidad">Versión en español</a></p>
  <p>The Spanish version is the reference text.</p>

  <h2>1. Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>
    RateHub is a web design and development studio operating in Argentina.
  </p>
  <p>
    Privacy contact: <a href="mailto:info@ratehub.com.ar">info@ratehub.com.ar</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>2. What data we process</h2>
  <p>This website currently has no forms or user accounts. The data we may receive is:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>What you send us.</strong> If you contact us through WhatsApp or email, we receive your name, your
      number or email address and the content of your message.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Technical visit data.</strong> The website hosting service may log data such as IP address, browser and
      date and time of the visit, for security and operation.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Your theme preference (light or dark).</strong> It is stored only in your browser and is not sent to our
      servers.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We currently do not use advertising or analytics cookies.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Sensitive data.</strong> Please do not send us health data or other sensitive data. We do not need it for
    any of our services.
  </p>

  <h2>3. What we use it for</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To answer your inquiry and, if you ask, to prepare a proposal.</li>
    <li>To keep the website secure and working.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your data or use it for third-party advertising.</p>

  <h2>4. Who we share it with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Website hosting:</strong> Vercel Inc., which processes visits on our behalf.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>WhatsApp (Meta):</strong> if you write to us there, the conversation is also governed by WhatsApp's terms
      and privacy policy.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Some of these providers may store data outside Argentina.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under Argentina's Personal Data Protection Law (Ley 25.326), you have the right to access, correct, update and
    request deletion of your data. To exercise them, write to
    <a href="mailto:info@ratehub.com.ar">info@ratehub.com.ar</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    The Agencia de Acceso a la Información Pública is the supervisory authority for Ley 25.326 and handles complaints
    about non-compliance with personal data protection rules.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If we change what data we collect (for example, by adding a form or analytics), we will update this policy before
    we start collecting it.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
